				<r3d:description language="eng">Published data is based on the drawings from three books published by Wäfler and Marschall.
Rock paintings in Indonesia were recorded during three short excursions by Markus Wäfler and Wolfgang Marschall. Threatened by environmental changes and human interventions and activities, these rock paintings represent the latest specimen of early drawings in that region.</r3d:description>
